@startuml
!theme plain

actor Admin
participant "Vue SPA" as Frontend
participant "FastAPI" as API
participant "filetype" as FT
database "Image Storage" as Storage
database "MongoDB" as DB

Admin -> Frontend: Select PNG/JPEG + name + type + bounds
Frontend -> API: POST /api/events/{id}/images\n(file, name, image_type, bounds)

API -> API: Validate file size (max 50MB)
API -> FT: Detect magic bytes
FT --> API: MIME type valid/invalid

API -> API: Parse bounds (west,south,east,north)

API -> Storage: Write file

API -> DB: Update Event.images\n(id, filename, name, type, bounds, preview)
API --> Frontend: { status: "ok", image: {...} }

Admin -> API: GET /api/events/{id}/satellite-images/{image_id}/access
API -> DB: Confirm event/image ownership
API --> Admin: Relative /images/{preview} path
Admin -> API: GET /images/{preview}
API -> Storage: Read preview/original
API --> Admin: Image response

@enduml
